## Data Flow Summary

```
GET /postings  (freelancer authenticated)
  → PostingController: computes matchPercentage per tile via MatchService
  → PostingTileDto.matchPercentage set for all tiles
  → JSON response includes matchPercentage for all

Frontend ExplorePage → PostingComponent:
  → renders <MatchBadge> ONLY when matchPercentage > 50
  → score still present in JSON even when ≤ 50 (just not rendered)

──────────────────────────────────────────────

GET /postings/{id}/match  (freelancer authenticated)
  → PostingController → MatchService.computeMatch(id, userId)
  → returns { matchPercentage: N }

Frontend ViewPostingPage:
  → fetches in parallel with posting detail
  → renders full score panel in PostingSidebar — always, regardless of value

──────────────────────────────────────────────



